{"id":"df4984a511d297c7","group":"91","path":"91/91-df-UTB-plus.md","title":"UTB加与原书全归纳 UTB 的对应","display":"df-UTB-plus — UTB加与原书全归纳 UTB 的对应","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Axiomatic Theories of Truth","book_abbrev":"91","label":"91-df-UTB-plus","aliases":["91-df-UTB-plus","91-df-UTB^+"],"display":"df-UTB-plus — UTB加与原书全归纳 UTB 的对应","depends_on":["[[91-df-UTB]]","[[91-df-induction-schema]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Axiomatic Theories of Truth"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"91"},{"key":"label","html":"91-df-UTB-plus"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>91-df-UTB-plus</span><span>91-df-UTB^+</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-UTB-plus — UTB加与原书全归纳 UTB 的对应"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"2f215d3f10d33ae6\" href=\"?note=2f215d3f10d33ae6\" title=\"91-df-UTB\">91-df-UTB</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"09791de618b277ba\" href=\"?note=09791de618b277ba\" title=\"91-df-induction-schema\">91-df-induction-schema</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Cn}_{\\mathrm{CL}}\">\\(\\operatorname{Cn}_{\\mathrm{CL}}\\)</span> 为经典一阶演绎闭包。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{UTB}\">\\(\\mathrm{UTB}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Ind}_{\\mathcal L_T}\">\\(\\mathrm{Ind}_{\\mathcal L_T}\\)</span> 采用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"2f215d3f10d33ae6\" href=\"?note=2f215d3f10d33ae6\" title=\"91-df-UTB\">91-df-UTB</a> 的全归纳版本。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}UTB\\text{-}plus}\\vdash\\quad\n\\mathrm{UTB}^{+}\\coloneqq\\operatorname{Cn}_{\\mathrm{CL}}(\\mathrm{UTB}\\cup\\mathrm{Ind}_{\\mathcal L_T})=\\mathrm{UTB}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}UTB\\text{-}plus}\\vdash\\quad\n\\mathrm{UTB}^{+}\\coloneqq\\operatorname{Cn}_{\\mathrm{CL}}(\\mathrm{UTB}\\cup\\mathrm{Ind}_{\\mathcal L_T})=\\mathrm{UTB}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>该节点保留旧名称。Theorem 7.5 包括完整归纳，因此旧版“UTB加证明 PA 全局反思，故非保守”的断言错误。\n归纳允许归纳已给出的谓词性质，却不补上缺失的编码量化组合公理。任一有限证明只使用有限个统一双条件矩阵，可用相应算术部分真理谓词替代 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T\">\\(T\\)</span>；真理归纳随之变成算术归纳。</p>\n<p>来源：Theorem 7.5 及其证明，印刷页 55–56，PDF 页 66–67。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"91-df-UTB","status":"resolved","id":"2f215d3f10d33ae6","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[91-df-UTB]]","embed":false},{"target":"91-df-induction-schema","status":"resolved","id":"09791de618b277ba","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[91-df-induction-schema]]","embed":false},{"target":"91-df-UTB","status":"resolved","id":"2f215d3f10d33ae6","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{UTB}$、$\\mathrm{Ind}_{\\mathcal L_T}$ 采用 [[91-df-UTB]] 的全归纳版本。","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\operatorname{Cn}_{\\mathrm{CL}}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{UTB}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Ind}_{\\mathcal L_T}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}UTB\\text{-}plus}\\vdash\\quad\n\\mathrm{UTB}^{+}\\coloneqq\\operatorname{Cn}_{\\mathrm{CL}}(\\mathrm{UTB}\\cup\\mathrm{Ind}_{\\mathcal L_T})=\\mathrm{UTB}.","display":true},{"tex":"T","display":false}],"bytes":1186,"backlinks":[{"id":"967c10482b90bea3","anchor":"ref-14","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[91-df-UTB-plus]]"